  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Invert sugar is an equimolar mixture of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>-</mo></math>glucose and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>-</mo></math>fructose, which is obtained by the hydrolysis of sucrose<br >Specific rotation of mixture is the half of the sum of specific rotation of both components,<math><mfrac><mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>52</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mn>92</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math><br ><img src=\"assets\\st0009_5efeae05c125.jpg\"/></p><p><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">(specific rotation </span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mn>52</mn><mo>°</mo></math><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>-</mo></math>fructose (specific rotation </span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>92</mn><mo>°</mo></math><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">) Sucrose specific rotation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mn>66</mn><mo>°</mo></math></span></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0009_b8a7e75ccd32.jpg\"/></p><p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mover accent=\"false\"><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math>.</p>"
